WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.600
- I couldn't begin this journey

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.950
without two women who have
been a part of my heart

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.730
for over 20 years.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.960
We are friends, we are fellow Angels.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.890
Please welcome my partners
in crime and life,

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.490
Lucy Liu and Cameron Diaz.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.301
(audience cheers)

00:00:17.301 --> 00:00:19.710
(women shrieking)

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.120
(Cameron laughs)

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.787
Oh my God, you guys!

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.371
This is the loudest this room has been!

00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:34.121
(women laughing)

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.610
Oh my God, you guys.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.510
It's hard to keep it together, man.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.260
I just felt like bursting into tears.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.950
I'm just so happy we're all together.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.160
- The three of us.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.300
I haven't seen you guys,
well, all three of us together

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.900
in a very long time.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.640
- We all made "Charlie's Angels."

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.940
We made it and we're making this show.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.970
And so when we sat around

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:02.310
and thought about who is this first guest,

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:04.510
nothing felt right, nothing was there,

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:08.870
and all of the sudden,
in a divine intervention,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:09.703
I was like,

00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:15.370
"Cameron and Lucy," and
everything fell into place.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.277
- Massive congratulations,
this is really major for you.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:24.930
- Listen, everybody says, "Who's
gonna be your first guest?"

00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:29.000
I mean, we've been through
everything together.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.845
- Well, everything, literally.
- Everything!

00:01:31.845 --> 00:01:34.835
- Literally every thing.

00:01:34.835 --> 00:01:38.252
(Cameron and Lucy laugh)

00:01:39.187 --> 00:01:41.216
- I haven't had a wedding that you guys

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:42.049
haven't been at.
(Lucy laughs)

00:01:42.049 --> 00:01:43.530
- [Cameron] I've been
to all your weddings.

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:46.290
- Exactly.
- I've been to all of them.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.320
- When our babies are born,

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.410
we hang out and we do
the birthday party thing.

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:54.770
I can't believe we're all moms now.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.630
That's when I got really emotional.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.660
First, I sent Cameron a video

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:04.380
and I'm saying, "Hey, listen,
I wanna ask you something.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.117
Will you come on the show?"

00:02:08.706 --> 00:02:10.460
I've never done this in my life.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:11.880
Because I'm so comfortable,

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:14.980
I mean, we have lived
together all over the world,

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.920
so of course, to save time,

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:19.733
I sent her a video while
I'm getting dressed.

00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:21.890
(Cameron and Lucy laughing)
And you don't see anything.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.650
I'm not that dumb, but I'm
getting out of the shower

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:27.130
and I'm wringing out of my towel.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.020
And I don't hear back
from her for two days,

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.777
and I'm like, "This is weird.

00:02:30.777 --> 00:02:32.610
"Did I, what is going on?"

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.647
So I text her and I'm like, "I don't care

00:02:34.647 --> 00:02:36.890
"about the question, are you okay?"

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.970
I don't hear again for two
days and I'm freaking out.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.707
So I call her and I'm
like, "What is going on?

00:02:42.707 --> 00:02:44.380
"I'm worried, is everything okay?"

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.910
She's like, "I don't know
what you're talking about."

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.430
I'm like, "The video,
you didn't get my video?"

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:53.832
Turns out, a young boy got the video.

00:02:53.832 --> 00:02:56.530
(audience laughs)
- Lucky him!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.070
- [Drew] Oh, no.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.183
- Oh, no, by the way,
it's seven minutes long.

00:03:01.183 --> 00:03:04.740
- Oh my God!
(women laughing)

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.960
- It's epic, I mean,

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.793
this is some material.
- So many secrets revealed.

00:03:06.793 --> 00:03:10.120
- This kid's gonna have this material.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.286
Honestly, this is gonna last
him three or four years.

00:03:13.286 --> 00:03:16.036
(women laugh)

00:03:16.036 --> 00:03:19.076
- I'm really hamming it up because it's--

00:03:19.076 --> 00:03:19.909
- 'Cause it's you?
- Yeah.

00:03:19.909 --> 00:03:21.140
- Yeah.
- Yeah, it was good.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:23.147
I was like, "Send me
that video immediately.

00:03:23.147 --> 00:03:26.370
"I need to know what is in that video,"

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:29.770
and the whole while, I'm just cracking up

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.790
because it's just--
- You need to send me

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.270
this video, as well, or do
it through someone else,

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.160
because I didn't get
your other video, either.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:35.993
- So then--
- Someone said,

00:03:35.993 --> 00:03:36.826
- I sent--
- "Did you get her video?"

00:03:36.826 --> 00:03:38.160
I was like, "No."

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.760
- No, something's wrong with my phone.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.880
So I sent Lucy this video, crying,

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.130
inviting her on the show,

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.900
saying--
- In her bathroom, crying.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.360
- I am in my bathroom.
- She was dressed.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.023
(Cameron and Lucy laugh)
- I was fully clothed

00:03:50.023 --> 00:03:52.020
this time, I didn't take the risk,

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:53.683
and she didn't get the video, either!

00:03:53.683 --> 00:03:56.250
(Lucy laughs)
- Come on.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.753
- I know, I know.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:03.430
The thing that I love about our friendship

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.870
is that we have been there

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.640
in all the big and important moments.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.850
We've also been there in the small moments

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.490
and the casual moments.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:16.510
And the reason we are such good
friends is because it's real

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.780
and we go through real
stuff with each other.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.333
It's not a Hollywood fairytale.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.480
- There's no aspect of life

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.130
that's an actual (laughs)
Hollywood fairytale.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.410
That's why it's a Hollywood fairytale,

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.200
'cause it doesn't exist.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.430
It's aspirational, it's hopeful,

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:37.010
but life is constantly
full of twists and turns

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.780
and all of those things
that happen over a lifetime,

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.360
because truly, it is now a lifetime.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:47.523
I mean, 20 years is a long time, y'all.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.555
I'm two years away from 50.

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:53.720
(laughs) That's nearly half my life.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:58.120
We have "Charlie's Angels" as our backdrop

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.530
that brought us together,

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.530
but then we get to fill in

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.150
all of life together in real moments,

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.840
which I just so appreciate

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:07.970
so much.
- It's so true.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.130
That's so well said, honey.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.440
- I know.
- Because it's

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.490
our touchpoint.
- Yeah.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:14.110
But then we have that foundation,

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.980
and then we've obviously
grown and learned and changed.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.560
And I mean, I know that
20 years has gone by,

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.500
but I feel like it was yesterday.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:26.500
I feel just as fresh and
as young and as creatively,

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.040
I don't know, excited
as I was when I started.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.947
- Here's the thing about
"Charlie's Angels,"

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:35.800
is that it's about girls

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.960
who can do all of these things

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:42.250
and love each other and
don't have competition

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.850
and support each other and laugh

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:48.450
and wanna talk about love and life so much

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.870
that they actually start
to talk about love and life

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.260
while they're fighting,
because women are so like that.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.720
It all intersects.
(Cameron and Lucy laugh)

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.480
And that is why I asked
you guys here today

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:00.320
is because if you're
gonna do something big,

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:02.820
you wanna do it with your girlfriends.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:06.293
- That's right.
(audience cheers)

00:06:09.042 --> 00:06:10.820
- And I love being together,

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:14.030
although are we really together?

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.490
Are we all together in this room?

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:19.330
- Are we, I feel like we're connected

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.930
in some way, but maybe--

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.060
- For anyone watching,

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:28.233
can you guess which one
of us isn't really here?

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.418
(Lucy gasps)

00:06:32.418 --> 00:06:33.457
(Lucy exhales)

00:06:33.457 --> 00:06:35.190
(Cameron and Lucy laugh)
- Welcome back!

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:37.652
- I'm the one in Los Angeles.

00:06:37.652 --> 00:06:41.140
(everyone laughs)

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.770
You gotta try this, it's so incredible.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.440
The ether does little
particles going out into space

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:50.340
and coming back and reamassing
into this beautiful space.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.695
You guys, it's crazy, you
should try it, it tingles!

00:06:52.695 --> 00:06:55.528
(everyone laughs)

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.950
- And if you guys wanna know

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.260
how that awesome,
groundbreaking technology works,

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.556
just go to our website at
thedrewbarrymoreshow.com.

00:07:04.556 --> 00:07:07.139
(upbeat music)

